#. Description of the plugin
msgid ""
"Scan and remove unused media files from your WordPress site to free "
"up disk space. Deep scans post content, ACF fields, WooCommerce, "
"Elementor, theme files, widgets, and more."
msgstr ""
"Imbas dan buang fail media yang tidak digunakan daripada tapak "
"WordPress anda untuk mengosongkan ruang cakera. Mengimbas secara "
"mendalam kandungan, medan ACF, WooCommerce, Elementor, fail tema, "
"widget dan lagi."

